      "chunk_id": "text_1",
      "quote": "we report the interim results of the review focusing on two research questions: What is the efficacy/effectiveness of COVID-19 vaccines in preventing SARS-CoV-2 infections (irrespective",
      "reason": "Syntheses are grouped by outcome (any SARS-CoV-2 infection vs asymptomatic infection), but explicit grouping of studies (e.g., by vaccine, dose, design) for each synthesis and linkage to PICO comparisons are only partially described in the main text (details deferred to supplements)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
